OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreezy and
OL,6,Fcloudy, with showers possible in the
OL,7,Fevening. These largely dying away by
OL,8,Fmidnight, leaving dry conditions with
OL,9,Fsome clear spells developing.
OL,10,FRemaining mild overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FBrightening through the
OL,13,Fmorning with widespread sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Largely dry throughout,
OL,15,Fthrough outbreaks of rain possible
OL,16,Fovernight in the north. Remaining
OL,17,Fbreezy and feeling warm in any
OL,18,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
