OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRainy
OL,6,Fand windy in the morning, turning
OL,7,Fdrier and brighter in the afternoon.
OL,8,FDry on Saturday, with lighter winds.
OL,9,FSunny and warm Sunday, with the odd
OL,10,Fshower possible.
